@startuml F2_TenantContract_Onboard_State
title Tenant Contract Onboard State Machine\nBoxes = ContractStatus enum · Arrows = who + what\n1 start · 1 end

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #333333
  FontSize 13
  FontStyle bold
}

[*] --> DRAFT : Admin import draft contract\n(Excel / create draft)

DRAFT --> AWAITING_ONBOARD : System promote on reception day\n(cron: expectedReceptionDate\nor moveInDate ≤ today)
DRAFT --> TERMINATED : Admin / Manager cancel
DRAFT --> TERMINATED : System auto-cancel\n(late ≥ 3 days after reception)

AWAITING_ONBOARD --> AWAITING_PAYMENT : Manager finish capture\n(photos + electric/water meters)\nPUT + completeCapture=true
AWAITING_ONBOARD --> TERMINATED : Admin / Manager cancel
AWAITING_ONBOARD --> TERMINATED : System auto-cancel\n(late ≥ 3 days)

AWAITING_PAYMENT --> AWAITING_CONFIRM : Tenant pay onboard QR\n(deposit + first rent via PayOS)
AWAITING_PAYMENT --> TERMINATED : Admin / Manager cancel
AWAITING_PAYMENT --> TERMINATED : System auto-cancel\n(late ≥ 3 days)

AWAITING_CONFIRM --> ACTIVE : Tenant + Manager confirm OTP\n(dual OTP both verified)
AWAITING_CONFIRM --> TERMINATED : Admin / Manager cancel
AWAITING_CONFIRM --> TERMINATED : System auto-cancel\n(late ≥ 3 days)

ACTIVE --> [*]
TERMINATED --> [*]

note right of AWAITING_CONFIRM
  If new tenant account:
  activate (OTP + set password)
  **before** contract confirm OTP
  (User/firstLogin — not ContractStatus)
end note

@enduml
